name tabls
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Better vertical spacing in tables and arrays
relocated 1
longdesc Modifies LaTeX's array and tabular environments to keep text
longdesc from touching other text or hlines above or below. Several new
longdesc parameters are defined and some standard macros are re-defined.
longdesc The package slows down compilation of tables, since each entry
longdesc is boxed twice.
runfiles size=3
 RELOC/tex/latex/tabls/tabls.sty
catalogue-also cellspace
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/tabls
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics table tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 3.5
